%!PS
/r { 0 0 3 -1 roll 1 rectfill } def
/b { { 1 } { 0 } ifelse r } def
/s { length r } def
/e { stopped b } def
/p { 1 2 add } bind def p r /q { 3 4 add } def q r
{ 5 } exec r 1 2 /add load exec r 6 exec r
(2 3 add) cvx exec r
/inner { 2 mul } def /outer { inner 1 add } bind def 5 outer r
{ 1 2 } readonly bind pop
{ exec } e
